  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國土計畫",
    "sub_ename": "SPATIAL PLANNING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為能夠對國土計畫的特性和內涵具有初步的認識及瞭解國內國土計畫法令與體制，深入瞭解台灣國土發展變遷和未來趨勢與議題指認。",
    "describe_eh": "By this course, we will train students have abilities to have a basic concepts of National Spatial Act, planning system ,legal basis. Including future development and topic in national spatial act.",
